City data
---------
lookups/airwatch_gps_cities.csv.gz and lookups/airwatch_gps_countries.csv are
derived from the GeoNames geographical database (https://www.geonames.org/):
cities1000 (places with 1,000 or more inhabitants, and seats of
administrative divisions), with the names of their
first-level (admin1, "state") and second-level (admin2, "county")
administrative divisions, and the GeoNames country names, as downloaded from
https://download.geonames.org/export/dump/ on 2026-10-22. GeoNames data is
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 License
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). The data is provided "as is"
without warranty or any representation of accuracy, timeliness or
completeness. Changes made for this add-on: converted to CSV with only the
columns it uses (position, country code, name, population, division names);
names trimmed of surrounding spaces; a second-level division with the same name
as the place left empty; places without a position or country code left out.
